WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.112 --> 00:00:02.419
I’M JESSE WATTERS.

00:00:02.420 --> 00:00:04.790
PRESIDENT RELEASE A VIDEO FROM

00:00:04.825 --> 00:00:07.674
WALTER REED MEDICAL CENTER

00:00:07.708 --> 00:00:09.646
UPDATING THE COUNTRY ON HIS

00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:10.696
CONDITION.

00:00:10.697 --> 00:00:16.000
&gt;&gt; I WANT TO THANK EVERYBODY,

00:00:16.001 --> 00:00:19.590
THE DOCTORS AND NURSES AT THE

00:00:19.591 --> 00:00:21.418
WALTER REED MEDICAL CENTER.

00:00:21.419 --> 00:00:23.143
I CAME HERE, WASN’T FEELING SO

00:00:23.178 --> 00:00:23.662
WELL.

00:00:23.696 --> 00:00:26.675
I FEEL MUCH BETTER NOW.

00:00:26.677 --> 00:00:28.862
WE ARE WORKING HARD TO GET ME

00:00:28.896 --> 00:00:30.339
ALL THE WAY BACK.

00:00:30.374 --> 00:00:32.692
I HAVE TO BE BACK BECAUSE WE

00:00:32.726 --> 00:00:33.992
STILL NEED TO MAKE AMERICA GREAT

00:00:33.993 --> 00:00:34.568
AGAIN.

00:00:34.603 --> 00:00:37.915
I HAVE DONE A GOOD JOB OF THAT.

00:00:37.917 --> 00:00:40.309
BUT WE HAVE STEPS TO GO, WE HAVE

00:00:40.310 --> 00:00:41.840
TO FINISH THAT JOB.

00:00:41.875 --> 00:00:44.644
I THINK I WILL BE BACK SOON.

00:00:44.679 --> 00:00:46.368
I LOOK FORWARD TO FINISHING UP

00:00:46.370 --> 00:00:48.143
THE CAMPAIGN WITH THE KINDS OF

00:00:48.144 --> 00:00:49.702
NUMBERS WE HAVE BEEN DOING.

00:00:49.737 --> 00:00:51.606
WE HAVE BEEN SO PROUD OF IT.

00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:53.437
THIS IS SOMETHING THAT HAS

00:00:53.472 --> 00:00:54.052
HAPPENED.

00:00:54.086 --> 00:00:55.966
IT HAPPENED TO MILLIONS OF

00:00:56.001 --> 00:00:57.783
PEOPLE ALL OVER THE WORLD.

00:00:57.818 --> 00:00:59.427
NOT JUST IN THE U.S.

00:00:59.429 --> 00:01:00.709
I’M FIGHTING FOR THEM ALL OVER

00:01:00.743 --> 00:01:01.597
THE WORLD.

00:01:01.598 --> 00:01:03.385
WE ARE GOING TO BEAT THIS

00:01:03.387 --> 00:01:05.228
CORONAVIRUS OR WHATEVER YOU WANT

00:01:05.229 --> 00:01:06.956
TO CALL IT AND WE’LL BITE

00:01:06.991 --> 00:01:07.772
SOUNDLY.

00:01:07.773 --> 00:01:10.368
SO MANY THINGS HAPPENED.

00:01:10.402 --> 00:01:12.658
IF YOU LOOK AT THE THERAPEUTICS

00:01:12.659 --> 00:01:13.692
I’M TAKING.

00:01:13.693 --> 00:01:16.812
AND OTHERS ARE COMING OUT SOON

00:01:16.846 --> 00:01:19.221
THAT FRANKLY THEY ARE MIRACLES.

00:01:19.223 --> 00:01:20.877
PEOPLE CRITICIZE ME WHEN I SAY

00:01:20.878 --> 00:01:21.360
THAT.

00:01:21.394 --> 00:01:23.626
BUT WE HAVE THINGS HAPPENING

00:01:23.660 --> 00:01:25.822
THAT LOOK LIKE THEY ARE MIRACLES

00:01:25.856 --> 00:01:27.102
COMING DOWN FROM GOD.

00:01:27.136 --> 00:01:29.953
I WANT TO TELL YOU THAT I’M

00:01:29.954 --> 00:01:31.371
STARTING TO FEEL GOOD.

00:01:31.405 --> 00:01:33.744
YOU DON’T KNOW OVER THE NEXT

00:01:33.779 --> 00:01:36.074
PERIOD OF A FEW DAYS, I GUESS

00:01:36.075 --> 00:01:37.555
THAT’S THE REAL TEST.

00:01:37.556 --> 00:01:39.238
SO WE’LL SEE WHAT HAPPENS THE

00:01:39.272 --> 00:01:40.360
NEXT COUPLE DAYS.

00:01:40.361 --> 00:01:43.214
I JUST WANT TO BE SO THANKFUL

00:01:43.249 --> 00:01:45.454
FOR ALL OF THE SUPPORTIVE SEEN,

00:01:45.455 --> 00:01:47.162
WHETHER IT’S ON TELEVISION OR

00:01:47.163 --> 00:01:49.004
READING ABOUT IT.

00:01:49.005 --> 00:01:51.928
MOST OF ALL I APPRECIATE WHAT’S

00:01:51.929 --> 00:01:54.887
BEEN SAID ABOUT IT AMERICAN

00:01:54.922 --> 00:01:57.553
PEOPLE, BY ALMOST A BIPARTISAN

00:01:57.587 --> 00:01:59.015
CONSENSUS OF AMERICAN PEOPLE.

00:01:59.017 --> 00:02:01.176
IT’S A BEAUTIFUL THING TO SEE,

00:02:01.177 --> 00:02:03.140
AND I VERY MUCH APPRECIATE IT.

00:02:03.141 --> 00:02:04.668
AND I WON’T FORGET IT.

00:02:04.702 --> 00:02:06.175
I PROMISE YOU THAT.

00:02:06.177 --> 00:02:09.533
I ALSO WANT TO THANK THE LEADERS

00:02:09.567 --> 00:02:11.232
OF THE WORLD FOR THEIR

00:02:11.234 --> 00:02:13.139
CONDOLENCES AND THEY KNOW WHAT

00:02:13.140 --> 00:02:14.277
WE ARE GOING THROUGH.

00:02:14.312 --> 00:02:15.983
THEY KNOW AS YOUR LEADER WHAT I

00:02:16.017 --> 00:02:17.489
HAVE TO GO THROUGH.

00:02:17.523 --> 00:02:19.924
BUT I HAD NO CHOICE BECAUSE I

00:02:19.958 --> 00:02:21.836
JUST DIDN’T WANT TO STAY IN THE

00:02:21.871 --> 00:02:22.666
WHITE HOUSE.

00:02:22.667 --> 00:02:25.170
STAY IN THE WHITE HOUSE, LOCK

00:02:25.171 --> 00:02:27.011
YOURSELF IN, DON’T EVER LEAVE.

00:02:27.012 --> 00:02:28.968
DON’T GO TO THE OVAL OFFICE.

00:02:29.003 --> 00:02:30.679
STAY UPSTAIRS AND ENJOY IT.

00:02:30.681 --> 00:02:32.752
DON’T SEE PEOPLE, DON’T TALK TO

00:02:32.753 --> 00:02:34.557
PEOPLE AND BE DONE WITH IT.

00:02:34.591 --> 00:02:36.016
AND I CAN’T DO THAT.

00:02:36.050 --> 00:02:37.624
I HAD TO BE OUT FRONT.

00:02:37.658 --> 00:02:38.807
THIS IS AMERICA.

00:02:38.842 --> 00:02:40.333
THIS IS THE UNITED STATES.

00:02:40.335 --> 00:02:41.783
THIS IS THE GREATEST COUNTRY IN

00:02:41.817 --> 00:02:42.827
THE WORLD.

00:02:42.828 --> 00:02:44.524
THIS IS THE MOST POWERFUL

00:02:44.525 --> 00:02:46.237
COUNTRY UNTIL WORLD.

00:02:46.238 --> 00:02:49.082
I CAN’T BE LOCKED UPSTAIRS IN A

00:02:49.117 --> 00:02:51.765
ROOM AND BE TOTALLY SAFE AND SAY

00:02:51.799 --> 00:02:52.831
WHATEVER HAPPENS, HAPPENS.

00:02:52.832 --> 00:02:54.438
I CAN’T DO THAT.

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:56.345
WE HAVE TO CONFRONT PROBLEMS.

00:02:56.379 --> 00:02:58.713
AS A LEADER YOU HAVE TO CON

00:02:58.714 --> 00:02:59.347
FRONT PROBLEMS.

00:02:59.382 --> 00:03:01.231
THERE HAS NEVER BEEN A GREAT

00:03:01.266 --> 00:03:02.521
LEADER THAT WOULD HAVE DONE

00:03:02.556 --> 00:03:02.931
THAT.

00:03:02.933 --> 00:03:05.038
I AM DOING WELL.

00:03:05.039 --> 00:03:07.174
I WANT TO THANK EVERYBODY.

00:03:07.175 --> 00:03:09.990
OUR FIRST LADY IS DOING VERY

00:03:10.025 --> 00:03:10.681
WELL.

00:03:10.683 --> 00:03:12.857
MELANIA ASKED ME TO SAY

00:03:12.858 --> 00:03:14.995
SOMETHING AS TO THE RESPECT SHE

00:03:14.996 --> 00:03:16.786
HAS FOR OUR COUNTRY, THE LOVE

00:03:16.787 --> 00:03:19.485
SHE HAS FOR OUR COUNTRY.

00:03:19.487 --> 00:03:21.409
WE ARE BOTH DOING WELL.

00:03:21.410 --> 00:03:23.122
MELANIA IS REALLY HANDLING IT

00:03:23.156 --> 00:03:24.410
VERY NICELY.

00:03:24.444 --> 00:03:27.722
AS YOU PROBABLY READ, SHE IS

00:03:27.756 --> 00:03:30.027
SLIGHTLY YOUNGER THAN ME, JUST A

00:03:30.062 --> 00:03:31.204
TINY BIT.

00:03:31.239 --> 00:03:33.249
AND WE NOTE DISEASE.

00:03:33.250 --> 00:03:35.971
WE KNOW THE SITUATION WITH AGE

00:03:36.005 --> 00:03:37.995
VERSUS YOUNGER PEOPLE.

00:03:37.996 --> 00:03:40.324
AND MELANIA IS HANDLING IT

00:03:40.326 --> 00:03:41.818
STATISTICALLY LIKE IT’S SUPPOSED

00:03:41.852 --> 00:03:43.207
TO BE HANDLED.

00:03:43.241 --> 00:03:46.514
AND THAT MAKES ME VERY HAPPY AND

00:03:46.549 --> 00:03:48.132
MAKES THE COUNTRY VERY HAPPY.

00:03:48.166 --> 00:03:49.999
BUT I’M ALSO DOING WELL, AND I

00:03:50.033 --> 00:03:51.261
THINK WE’LL HAVE A VERY GOOD

00:03:51.295 --> 00:03:51.788
RESULT.

00:03:51.789 --> 00:03:53.799
OVER THE NEXT FEW DAYS WE’LL

00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:55.045
PROBABLY KNOW FOR SURE.

00:03:55.079 --> 00:03:57.066
SO I JUST WANT TO THANK

00:03:57.100 --> 00:03:58.838
EVERYBODY OUT THERE, EVERYBODY.

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:01.342
ALL OVER THE WORLD.

00:04:01.377 --> 00:04:02.845
SPECIFICALLY THE OUTPOURING OF

